<title>POLAND: NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 300 MLN 182-DAY NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 300 MLN 182-DAY NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland</p>
<p>offered to sell 300 million zlotys of 182-day NBP-bills, the</p>
<p>bank said.</p>
<p>Full details below.</p>
<p>    Deadline hour		 - 12:00</p>
<p>    Date of settlement	  - December 31, 1996</p>
<p>Maturity of bills offered - July 1, 1997</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
